<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Raise Dead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 27)
Mana: 60
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast raise dead &lt;player&gt;
</pre>
<p>Pulls a dead player's soul out of Valhalla and back into their body. It only 
works in the short time after their death while their spirit is still in 
Valhalla, before they come back to life in their temple by themselves (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>), and only if you have their corpse: lying in the room with you, 
or carried.
</p><p>The player arrives where you are, back in their body with everything the 
corpse held, but stunned, with no hit points, no mana and no endurance left: 
look after them. It costs you both 2,500 experience points.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Resurrection</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>